  "title": "Combo chart",
  "group": "Charts",
  "order": 4.6,
  "summary": {
    "en": "Bars for what happened in each period and a line for what was expected (a plan, a forecast, last year), on one shared scale, with optional dashed reference lines for fixed thresholds. Drawn from data like the area chart.",
    "id": "Batang untuk apa yang terjadi di setiap periode dan garis untuk apa yang diharapkan (rencana, prakiraan, tahun lalu), pada satu skala bersama, dengan garis acuan putus-putus opsional untuk ambang tetap. Digambar dari data seperti area chart."
  },
  "titleId": "Combo chart",
  "react": false,
  "examples": {
    "en": [
      {
        "title": "Sales against plan",
        "desc": "Bars grow from the baseline on first view; the plan line fades in. Point at a month: the whole column is tinted and the tooltip gives both values. Switch the plan off in the legend.",
        "html": "<section class=\"chart-card\" aria-labelledby=\"cb-q\">\n  <div class=\"chart-card__head\"><div class=\"chart-card__titles\"><div class=\"chart-card__q\" id=\"cb-q\">Are sales ahead of plan?</div><div class=\"chart-card__sub\">Course sales per month, 2026</div></div></div>\n  <div class=\"chart\" data-lds-chart='{\"label\":\"Monthly course sales against plan, 2026. Ahead of plan since July; November $56,000 against $52,000 planned. December still open.\",\"x\":[\"Jan\",\"Feb\",\"Mar\",\"Apr\",\"May\",\"Jun\",\"Jul\",\"Aug\",\"Sep\",\"Oct\",\"Nov\",\"Dec\"],\"xFull\":[\"Jan 2026\",\"Feb 2026\",\"Mar 2026\",\"Apr 2026\",\"May 2026\",\"Jun 2026\",\"Jul 2026\",\"Aug 2026\",\"Sep 2026\",\"Oct 2026\",\"Nov 2026\",\"Dec 2026\"],\"xName\":\"Month\",\"format\":{\"prefix\":\"$\",\"compact\":true},\"series\":[{\"name\":\"Sales\",\"values\":[31000,34000,29000,38000,41000,37000,44000,47000,43000,52000,56000,0],\"kind\":\"bar\"},{\"name\":\"Plan\",\"values\":[32000,33000,34000,36000,38000,40000,42000,44000,46000,49000,52000,55000],\"kind\":\"line\",\"dashed\":true,\"color\":4}],\"refs\":[{\"value\":50000,\"label\":\"Break-even $50k\"}],\"height\":240}'></div>\n</section>"
      },
      {
        "title": "A week against a daily goal",
        "desc": "A flat goal line in the neutral color: days above it are easy to count.",
        "html": "<section class=\"chart-card\" style=\"max-width: 520px;\" aria-labelledby=\"cb-w\">\n  <div><div class=\"chart-card__q\" id=\"cb-w\">Did I keep my daily goal?</div><div class=\"chart-card__sub\">Hours studied per day, this week</div></div>\n  <div class=\"chart\" data-lds-chart='{\"label\":\"Hours studied per day this week with the average score of that day&#39;s quizzes. More hours, higher scores, except Saturday.\",\"x\":[\"Mon\",\"Tue\",\"Wed\",\"Thu\",\"Fri\",\"Sat\",\"Sun\"],\"xName\":\"Day\",\"format\":{\"decimals\":1},\"series\":[{\"name\":\"Hours studied\",\"values\":[1.5,2,2.5,1,3,4,0.5],\"kind\":\"bar\",\"color\":3},{\"name\":\"Goal per day\",\"values\":[2,2,2,2,2,2,2],\"kind\":\"line\",\"dashed\":true,\"color\":\"neutral\"}],\"height\":200}'></div>\n</section>"
      }
    ],
    "id": [
      {
        "title": "Realisasi dibanding rencana",
        "desc": "Batang tumbuh dari garis dasar saat pertama terlihat; garis rencana muncul memudar. Arahkan kursor ke satu bulan: seluruh kolom diberi tint dan tooltip memberi kedua nilainya. Matikan rencana di legenda.",
        "html": "<section class=\"chart-card\" aria-labelledby=\"cb-q\">\n  <div class=\"chart-card__head\"><div class=\"chart-card__titles\"><div class=\"chart-card__q\" id=\"cb-q\">Apakah penerimaan pajak di atas rencana?</div><div class=\"chart-card__sub\">Realisasi pajak daerah per bulan, dalam miliar rupiah, 2026</div></div></div>\n  <div class=\"chart\" data-lds-chart='{\"label\":\"Realisasi pajak daerah per bulan dibanding rencana, 2026. Di atas rencana sejak Juli; November Rp 56 M dibanding rencana Rp 52 M. Desember belum ditutup.\",\"x\":[\"Jan\",\"Feb\",\"Mar\",\"Apr\",\"Mei\",\"Jun\",\"Jul\",\"Agu\",\"Sep\",\"Okt\",\"Nov\",\"Des\"],\"xFull\":[\"Jan 2026\",\"Feb 2026\",\"Mar 2026\",\"Apr 2026\",\"Mei 2026\",\"Jun 2026\",\"Jul 2026\",\"Agu 2026\",\"Sep 2026\",\"Okt 2026\",\"Nov 2026\",\"Des 2026\"],\"xName\":\"Bulan\",\"format\":{\"prefix\":\"Rp \",\"suffix\":\" M\"},\"series\":[{\"name\":\"Realisasi\",\"values\":[31,34,29,38,41,37,44,47,43,52,56,0],\"kind\":\"bar\"},{\"name\":\"Rencana\",\"values\":[32,33,34,36,38,40,42,44,46,49,52,55],\"kind\":\"line\",\"dashed\":true,\"color\":4}],\"refs\":[{\"value\":50,\"label\":\"Ambang Rp 50 M\"}],\"height\":240}'></div>\n</section>"
      },
      {
        "title": "Satu minggu dibanding target harian",
        "desc": "Garis target datar berwarna netral: hari-hari di atasnya mudah dihitung.",
        "html": "<section class=\"chart-card\" style=\"max-width: 520px;\" aria-labelledby=\"cb-w\">\n  <div><div class=\"chart-card__q\" id=\"cb-w\">Apakah target angkut sampah tercapai?</div><div class=\"chart-card__sub\">Sampah terangkut per hari dalam ton, minggu ini</div></div>\n  <div class=\"chart\" data-lds-chart='{\"label\":\"Sampah terangkut per hari minggu ini dibanding target harian 2 ton. Target tercapai pada Rabu, Jumat, dan Sabtu.\",\"x\":[\"Sen\",\"Sel\",\"Rab\",\"Kam\",\"Jum\",\"Sab\",\"Min\"],\"xName\":\"Hari\",\"format\":{\"decimals\":1,\"suffix\":\" ton\"},\"series\":[{\"name\":\"Sampah terangkut\",\"values\":[1.5,2,2.5,1,3,4,0.5],\"kind\":\"bar\",\"color\":3},{\"name\":\"Target harian\",\"values\":[2,2,2,2,2,2,2],\"kind\":\"line\",\"dashed\":true,\"color\":\"neutral\"}],\"height\":200}'></div>\n</section>"
      }
    ]
  },
